            "paragraph": "SAd are strictly linked to that of the Ionian Sea (IS) by means of the Bimodal Oscillating System (BiOS) that changes the circulation of the North Ionian Gyre (NIG) from cyclonic to anticyclonic and vice versa, on decadal time scale (Ga\u010di\u0107 et al., 2011; Civitarese et al., 2023).",
